    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d821">

                <pb facs="0788" n="778" xml:id="pg778"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.61331/246: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the First Secretary of Embassy
                        in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Smyth</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >at Peiping</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-01-04T17:00:00-05:00">January 4, 1941—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Tsingtao’s 152, December 30, 5 p.m.<anchor n="88" xml:id="d821-f1"/> Universal
                    Leaf Tobacco Company. The Department desires that, unless you perceive
                    objection, you take up through the Japanese Embassy at Peiping the matter of
                    Japanese interference with the activities of the Universal Leaf Tobacco Company,
                    carefully avoiding, however, any reference to “allotments” or to any agreement
                    which the Universal Leaf Tobacco Company may have made with the Japanese
                    authorities in derogation of the company’s rights as an American firm to conduct
                    its business in China.<anchor n="89" xml:id="d821-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>Sent to Peiping. Repeated to Chungking, Shanghai, Tsingtao. Peiping please repeat
                    to Tokyo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d821-f1" n="88" xml:id="d821-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d821-f2" n="89" xml:id="d821-f2-content">
                <p>In telegram No. 13, January 7, 3 p.m., the Embassy at Peiping reported its
                    representations to the Japanese Embassy on January 7 (803.61331/250).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
